WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.200
Your work schedule. Your time. All in one place.
Shift + helps regular workers, rotating-shift teams
and people with changing patterns stay one step ahead.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:20.000
See your working week clearly. Browse your calendar,
check your roster, and know whether an Early, Late,
Night or Rest day is coming next.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:33.800
Set work alarms around the shift you are actually doing.
Use Book On and Book Off reminders when that is the
language of your workplace, and check Alarm Centre.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:59.800
Keep annual leave and overtime visible. Build a custom
repeating roster with Shift + Premium. Bring your schedule
into Home Assistant for dashboards and smart-home routines.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:11.500
Shift +. Your roster. Your alarms. Your time.
Available on Google Play.
